    "body": "## What and why\n\nThe completed bounded pair run never corrects its first residual at input245/position4. This native diagnostic determines whether any legal Generate pair setting could overcome the frozen Copy competition there. It authenticates the saved candidate, reconstructs all4096 Generate/U scores and the full native pool, then uses the admitted integer kernel to compare an optimistic target upper bound with rival Copy mass across every possible common reference. The read-only atom inspection API leaves serving selection unchanged.\n\n## Result\n\nAll9 conservative references exclude target267: at the current reference its upper mass is319960263 versus rival307 Copy2147483648 Q31. The target already has its maximum four-pair sum28. **REJECT a wider or repeated pair-only pass with these terms frozen.** This is a fixed-state exclusion, not global capacity or a language improvement. Accepted8/512 and separate unselected pair6/15 and coupled9/15 remain unchanged.\n\nThe next task is source/design assessment of complete-episode shared occurrence/progression credit coupled to Generate, accounting for existing Prefix/donor-state/U mechanisms and the earlier negatives. No new fit, candidate composition or answer-specific serving case is admitted by this result.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Actual focused checks at exact delivery head: three example tests, one native atom API test, formatting, diff and claim-wording checks. Exact-head review/check receipt posted separately before queueing.\n- [x] Research record: `docs/labs/pair-copy-bound-2026-10-09/README.md`, input/runtime/result identities, sealed report archive, source/result reviews and cumulative costs.\n- [x] Newest current-state entry with next action; concurrent peer entry retained.\n- [x] Prior attribution record linked to this completed follow-up; stale-claim search performed.\n- [x] STATUS/ROADMAP add the scoped obstruction. M2/#2028 will be updated only after verified merge; milestone status and accepted artifact are unchanged.\n- [x] README unchanged: no capability, headline result, model or serving mechanism changed.\n- [x] Claim-wording gate passes.\n- [x] iCloud round-trip verified: `codex-pair-copy-bound-20261009`,1467904 bytes, MD5 `6f089bba16e0a5f65fde707e37c20afc`.\n- [x] After merge: verify fresh main/source blobs, delete temporary GitHub/local branch and owned worktree, run hygiene, then post the measured result on M2.\n\nThe cold build's loader type mismatch is retained and charged; the repaired loader constructs its full expected binding from sealed source metadata. The successful scientific run takes0.53 supervised seconds,77.9MB max RSS. No gradients, proposals, GPU job or whole-answer run occurs.\n\nReferences #2030\n",
